        "text": "Analyze the attached receipt image and extract the receipt information.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. Do not include markdown, explanations, or ```json code fences.\n\nUse exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"merchant_name\": \"\",\n  \"total_amount\": null,\n  \"currency\": \"\",\n  \"receipt_date\": \"\",\n  \"receipt_number\": \"\",\n  \"subtotal\": null,\n  \"tax_amount\": null,\n  \"payment_method\": \"\",\n  \"items\": []\n}\n\nRules:\n- Read the information directly from the receipt image.\n- Do not guess information that is not visible.\n- Use null for missing numeric values.\n- Use an empty string for missing text values.\n- receipt_date must use YYYY-MM-DD when possible.\n- total_amount must be the final amount paid.\n- subtotal must be the subtotal before tax when visible.\n- tax_amount must be the tax amount when visible.\n- payment_method should be Cash, Card, GCash, or another method only when visible.\n- items should contain the purchased item name, quantity, and price when visible.\n- If this is not a receipt, return the JSON structure with empty/null values.",
        "inputType": "binary",
        "options": {}
      },
